# C++ / Rust
cpp/**/build/
cmake-build-*/
rust/**/target/
# 库 crate 不锁定依赖版本；CI 跑测试会生成 Cargo.lock，忽略它以免 cargo publish 判定 working directory dirty
rust/**/Cargo.lock

# Go
go/**/vendor/
go/**/*.test
go/**/coverage.out

# Node / Swift / Zig
node/**/node_modules/
node/**/dist/
node/**/package-lock.json
node/**/*.tsbuildinfo
swift/**/.build/
swift/**/.swiftpm/
zig/**/zig-out/
zig/**/.zig-cache/
zig/**/zig-cache/
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/

# 凭据只走 CI Secrets / 环境变量，不进仓库
*凭据*
*.gpg
*.asc
secrets/
gradle.properties.local
